* Since for each sensor a voltage too high or too low \nindicates unsafe operation a window comparator can be \nused to output logic HIGH when the input signal Vin is \nwithin a certain range, and logic LOW when outside of \nsaid range.
* The purpose of the window comparators is to output a logic\nHIGH when a sensor detects safe operation.
