* Isolation Switch Input Logic
* 74HC08D, 63 \nAND Gate Placeholders
* Standard AND gate are used as placeholders for\n74HC08D, 653 AND gates\n \nThe place holder AND gates output 1 V. whereas in reality\nthe 74HC08D, 653 can output up to Vcc volts (5 V).
* Two gates are used here to represent that the\n74HC08D, 653 AND gates only have two inputs.\nSo two gates are required for three inputs.
